  THE PIPELINE (each step feeds the next):
    t3 check      toolchain OK? (container, python, booksim, timeloop, astrasim)
    t3 sim        sweep 11 topologies x 5 injection rates (~5 min, saves as it goes)
                    -> results/baseline/topology_sweep.json
    t3 astrasim   same sweep driven by real collective traces (~2-25 min)
                    -> results/baseline/astrasim_sweep.json
    t3 report     rankings + aggregate.csv + latency_curves.png
