  ANALYSIS & REPORTING
    analysis      Sweep JSON -> table  |  aggregate  Merge -> aggregate.csv
    plot          Curves PNG           |  report     analysis+aggregate+plot
    plot-config   Guided: pick config + style -> curves PNG
    compare-curves  N-way overlay of sweep curves from several configs -> PNG
    compare-bars    Bar chart from veritx compare results -> PNG
    compare-heat    Win/loss heatmap across many compare results -> PNG
    viz           Visualize gallery (every plot one picker away)
    viz-open      Open the most recent PNG
    quick-compare Guided: trace x topologies -> veritx compare -> bars data
    webui         Browser control room: click commands, live output, PNG gallery
    veritx        VeritX DSE (where/compare/sweep, booksim backend)
    report        Full report (make)   |  energy     Needs timeloop stats (see t3 help energy)
    dashboard     Plotly dashboard

  DEVELOPMENT
    selfcheck     PA script selfchecks  |  lint  Syntax check
    clean         Remove results/ + __pycache__

  MODELS & LOGS
    t3 model             list the workload registry (models + collectives)
    t3 model-add         guided: define a custom model → workloads/<name>.json
