    t3 logs              recent sweep sessions + event drill-down (logs/)
    t3 logs-prune        delete session logs older than N days (asks)

  ENV VARS (prefix any command, e.g. MODEL=all_reduce t3 astrasim):
    CONFIG=baseline   selects configs/<name> + results/<name>/
    MODEL=all_reduce  astrasim workload: llama7b, llama70b, all_reduce, ...
    TOPO=mesh4x4      astrasim: only topos matching this substring
    RATES=0.01,0.02   sim: injection rates (default 0.002..0.03)
    ASTRASIM_TIMEOUT=5400  per-topo sim budget in seconds (default 1800)
    IMAGE=...         container image override (host only)

  REMEMBERED FOR YOU: CONFIG/MODEL/TOPO/RATES picked in the menu are saved to
  results/.t3_state and restored next session (an env var on the command line
